{
  "about": "The NPCs and locs that have an examine text, by type id. The texts are Jagex's words, so they aren't here: each gets a key in the dialogue file (examine.npc_<id>, examine.loc_<id>), which Sam fills from the Wiki (2026-10-25). wiki says where on the Wiki the text is, when not the infobox of the page named after it; also lists other ids that show as this NPC (multi-NPCs, which the client may send either way). NPCs: those spawned in npc-spawns. Locs: every named loc type in Lumbridge Castle and its cellar (the 241 cache, map squares 50,50 and 50,150), and those the rest of Lumbridge's content uses; and every named loc type outside the castle in the rest of Lumbridge (map squares 49 to 51 by 49 to 51, west of the Al Kharid fence at x 3268, every level; the 241 cache, 2026-10-30), keyed one per id until the Wiki shows ids sharing a text; also lists other ids that share the text.",
